# Files that stay in the repo and out of the distributed package.
# Exact relative paths, one per line -- modkit matches literally, no globs.

# The SDK suite and the probes it grew out of. A shipped test that requires
# an engine module reads as a private require against the archive
# (CONTRIBUTING-mods.md "What the PR must contain", 2).
#
# Eleven names were removed from this list when the twenty-one dead probes
# were deleted: they all loaded `tests/drivers/util.lua`, a harness that
# exists neither in this tree nor in any build, so every one of them failed
# on its first line. modkit matches literally, so an entry for a file that
# is gone is not an error -- it is just a lie about what the package
# excludes, which is worse.
tests/dramatic_shape_test.lua

# Authoring tools. These run by hand on a machine that has imported its own
# ROM, read the local cache, and emit assets/voxels/*.lua; the carved models
# are what a player installs, the carving is not.
tools/build_voxels.py
tools/contact_sheets.py
tools/building_images.py
tools/building_voxels.py
tools/voxel-survey.md
assets/docs/buidling_to_voxel/sprite_extract.py
assets/docs/buidling_to_voxel/voxel_build_verify.py

# assets/docs/**.md stays in: data/voxel_heights.lua points a modder at the
# building catalogue, and the methodology is where the geometry's provenance
# is written down.

# The generator sheets the ground art was cut from. A contact sheet is a
# megabyte and a half of paper around six sixteen-pixel drawings; the strips
# in assets/ground/ are what the mod loads, and these are what they were cut
# from (tools/sheet2strip.ps1). Kept in the repo so the art can be recut,
# out of the package so a player does not download nine megabytes of them.
assets/ground/source/snowleve.png
assets/ground/source/snowlevearvore.png
assets/ground/source/snowmedioarvore.png
assets/ground/source/snowpesado.png
assets/ground/source/snowpesadoarvore.png

# The sheet converter itself: it runs by hand on an authoring machine and
# needs PowerShell and System.Drawing, neither of which a player has.
tools/sheet2strip.ps1

# Source GLB for the 3D grass tuft (~21 MB of 4K PBR maps). The shipped
# bake is assets/ground/grass/grass.png + grass.mesh.bin (~90 KB); rebuild
# with tools/optimize_grass_glb.py after replacing the GLB.
assets/ground/grass/grass-texture.glb
tools/optimize_grass_glb.py

# The probes for the newest features, on the same rule as the suite above.
tests/ecology_ground_probe.lua
tests/rayfx_water_probe.lua
tests/comforts_probe.lua
tests/puddle_debug.lua
tests/daynight_dial_probe.lua
tests/night_probe.lua
tests/shadow_length_probe.lua
